### ⚠️ Critical Notes & Caveats

1.  **Greedy Purity Warning (Block 10 & 13):**
   1.43.431.224 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =   1463, tg =  24.57 t/s, tg_3s =  28.72 t/s
